html:
Here's my take on this: a landing page for a fictional open-source columnar database called **STRATA**, built around one central idea — the hero *is* the product. Instead of a screenshot or illustration, the hero contains a real, working in-browser SQL shell with hand-rolled query parsing, command history, and box-drawing result tables. Data engineers don't trust marketing; they trust a prompt.

I went with a warm bone-paper editorial base, ink typography, one vermilion accent, and a phosphor-green terminal — deliberately not the usual blue/purple SaaS look.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>STRATA — the open-source columnar database for data engineers</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;600;700;800;900&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#F2EEE3; --panel:#E9E4D3; --ink:#181410;
    --mut:rgba(24,20,16,.62); --hair:rgba(24,20,16,.15); --hair2:rgba(24,20,16,.34);
    --acc:#D9481C; --accd:#B23A14;
    --term:#0F130D; --phos:#8BE6A0; --txt:#C7D6C2; --dim:#8FA68A; --err:#FF8A5E; --warm:#E8D28A;
    --mono:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace; --sans:'Archivo',sans-serif;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:400 16px/1.6 var(--sans);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  ::selection{background:var(--acc);color:var(--paper)}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}
  .mono{font-family:var(--mono)}

  /* ---------- header ---------- */
  header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(242,238,227,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair)}
  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:34px;height:62px}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:600 15px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.22em}
  .brand svg{display:block}
  .navlinks{display:flex;gap:26px;margin-left:auto}
  .navlinks a{font:500 12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mut);transition:color .2s}
  .navlinks a:hover{color:var(--acc)}
  .starbtn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:600 12px var(--mono);border:1px solid var(--hair2);background:transparent;color:var(--ink);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:99px;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}
  .starbtn:hover{border-color:var(--ink)}
  .starbtn.on svg{fill:var(--acc);stroke:var(--acc)}
  .starbtn svg{transition:.2s}
  .btn-dl{font:600 12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--ink);padding:9px 16px;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}
  .btn-dl:hover{background:var(--acc);border-color:var(--acc)}

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{padding:84px 0 0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(24,20,16,.09) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:26px 26px}
  .kicker{font:500 12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--acc);margin-bottom:26px}
  h1{line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.03em}
  .h-sql{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font:600 clamp(1.05rem,2.6vw,1.7rem) var(--mono);letter-spacing:.02em;color:var(--acc);margin-bottom:6px}
  .h-sql .blink{display:inline-block;width:.55em;height:1.05em;background:var(--acc);animation:blink 1.1s step-end infinite}
  @keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}
  .h-big{display:block;font:900 clamp(4rem,10.5vw,8.6rem)/0.95 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.045em}
  .h-big i{font-style:normal;color:var(--acc)}
  .sub{max-width:56ch;margin:30px 0 34px;font-size:18px;color:var(--mut)}
  .sub b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  code.k{font:500 .86em var(--mono);background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--hair);padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;white-space:nowrap}
  .ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:64px}
  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:600 14px var(--mono);padding:15px 24px;border:1px solid var(--ink);cursor:pointer;transition:.25s}
  .btn.primary{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
  .btn.primary:hover{background:var(--acc);border-color:var(--acc)}
  .btn.primary svg{transition:transform .25s}
  .btn.primary:hover svg{transform:translateX(4px)}
  .btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink)}
  .btn.ghost:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}

  /* ---------- terminal ---------- */
  .term{background:var(--term);border:1px solid #000;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(24,20,16,.55)}
  .term-bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);font:500 11px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--dim)}
  .term-out{padding:18px 20px 6px;height:330px;overflow:auto;font:400 13px/1.62 var(--mono);color:var(--txt);white-space:pre;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#2b3527 transparent}
  .term-out::-webkit-scrollbar{width:8px}.term-out::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#2b3527;border-radius:4px}
  .term-out .ln{min-height:1.62em}
  .term-out .cmd{margin-top:14px}
  .tp{color:var(--phos);font-weight:600}
  .ok{color:var(--phos)} .ok .tick{color:var(--phos)}
  .dim{color:var(--dim)} .er{color:var(--err)} .wr{color:var(--warm)}
  .tbl{color:var(--txt);margin:2px 0}
  .term-line{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:baseline;padding:10px 20px 16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09)}
  .term-line .tp{flex:none}
  .tinput{white-space:pre;color:var(--txt);outline:none;min-height:1.6em;flex:1}
  #mcur{background:var(--phos);color:var(--term);animation:blink 1.1s step-end infinite}
  .term-line:not(.focused) #mcur{background:transparent;color:var(--dim);animation:none}
  #tinput{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;font:inherit;border:0;cursor:text}
  .ph{color:#5c6e5a}
  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin:16px 0 0}
  .chip{font:500 11.5px var(--mono);border:1px solid var(--hair2);background:transparent;color:var(--ink);padding:7px 13px;border-radius:99px;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}
  .chip:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);border-color:var(--ink)}
  .chips .hint{margin-left:auto;font:400 11px var(--mono);color:var(--mut)}
  .chips kbd{border:1px solid var(--hair2);border-bottom-width:2px;border-radius:4px;padding:0 5px;font-family:var(--mono)}

  /* ---------- stats strip ---------- */
  .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-block:1px solid var(--hair);margin-top:70px}
  .stat{padding:28px 26px;border-left:1px solid var(--hair)}
  .stat:first-child{border-left:0}
  .stat .v{font:800 clamp(1.8rem,3.2vw,2.6rem)/1 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .stat .v em{font-style:normal;color:var(--acc);font-size:.55em;font-weight:700;margin-left:2px}
  .stat .l{font:400 11.5px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--mut);margin-top:9px}

  /* ---------- sections ---------- */
  section{padding:110px 0 0}
  .shead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:22px}
  .shead .n{font:600 12px var(--mono);color:var(--acc);letter-spacing:.1em}
  .shead .t{font:500 12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--mut)}
  .shead::after{content:"";flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--hair)}
  h2{font:800 clamp(2rem,4.6vw,3.4rem)/1.06 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:22ch}

  /* why rows */
  .why{margin-top:56px;border-top:1px solid var(--hair)}
  .wrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:96px 1fr 150px;gap:30px;padding:44px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair);align-items:start}
  .wrow .idx{font:700 15px var(--mono);color:var(--acc);padding-top:8px}
  .wrow h3{font:700 clamp(1.3rem,2.4vw,1.8rem)/1.15 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:12px}
  .wrow p{color:var(--mut);max-width:62ch;font-size:15.5px}
  .wrow svg{color:var(--ink);justify-self:end;margin-top:4px}

  /* pipeline */
  .pipe-fig{margin-top:54px;border:1px solid var(--hair);background:var(--panel);border-radius:10px;padding:26px 18px 12px}
  .pipe-fig svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
  .pipe-cap{font:400 11.5px var(--mono);color:var(--mut);padding:12px 6px 8px;border-top:1px solid var(--hair);margin-top:14px;letter-spacing:.06em}
  .flow{stroke:var(--hair2);stroke-width:1.2;fill:none;stroke-dasharray:4 6;animation:dash 1.6s linear infinite}
  @keyframes dash{to{stroke-dashoffset:-10}}

  /* marquee */
  .marq{overflow:hidden;border-block:1px solid var(--hair);margin-top:110px;background:var(--panel)}
  .mtrack{display:flex;gap:56px;width:max-content;padding:15px 0;animation:slide 46s linear infinite}
  .marq:hover .mtrack{animation-play-state:paused}
  @keyframes slide{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
  .mit{font:400 12.5px var(--mono);white-space:nowrap;color:var(--mut)}
  .mit b{color:var(--acc);font-weight:600;margin-right:10px}
  .mit .dim{color:var(--mut);opacity:.7}

  /* bench */
  .bench-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,380px) 1fr;gap:60px;margin-top:56px;align-items:start}
  .btabs{display:flex;gap:22px;margin-bottom:34px}
  .btab{font:600 12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;background:none;border:none;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;color:var(--mut);padding:6px 2px;cursor:pointer;text-transform:uppercase;transition:.2s}
  .btab.on{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--acc)}
  .brow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr 110px;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px}
  .blab{font:500 12px var(--mono);color:var(--mut)}
  .brow.lead .blab{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  .btrack{height:30px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--hair)}
  .bfill{height:100%;width:0;background:var(--ink);transition:width .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.2,1)}
  .brow.lead .bfill{background:var(--acc)}
  .brow.go .bfill{width:var(--w)}
  .bval{font:600 13px var(--mono);opacity:0;transition:opacity .4s .65s}
  .brow.lead .bval{color:var(--acc)}
  .brow.go .bval{opacity:1}
  .fnote{font:400 11.5px var(--mono);color:var(--mut);margin-top:34px;line-height:1.8;border-top:1px solid var(--hair);padding-top:18px;grid-column:1/-1}
  .fnote code{color:var(--accd)}

  /* install */
  .itabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:52px 0 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .itab{font:600 12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;padding:11px 20px;border:1px solid var(--hair2);border-bottom:none;background:transparent;color:var(--mut);cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;transition:.2s}
  .itab.on{background:var(--term);color:var(--phos);border-color:#000}
  .ipanel{position:relative;background:var(--term);border:1px solid #000;border-radius:0 10px 10px 10px;padding:26px 26px;min-height:190px}
  .ipanel pre{font:400 13.5px/1.75 var(--mono);color:var(--txt);white-space:pre;overflow-x:auto}
  .ipanel .d{color:var(--dim)} .ipanel .p{color:var(--phos)} .ipanel .c{color:var(--dim)}
  .copyb{position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font:500 11px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--dim);background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding:7px 12px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}
  .copyb:hover{color:var(--phos);border-color:var(--phos)}
  .inote{font:400 12px var(--mono);color:var(--mut);margin-top:16px}

  /* community */
  .comm{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:end}
  .comm p{color:var(--mut);margin:22px 0 34px;max-width:52ch}
  .comm .nums{font:500 12.5px var(--mono);color:var(--mut);letter-spacing:.05em;border-top:1px solid var(--hair);padding-top:16px;margin-bottom:0}
  .comm .nums b{color:var(--ink)}
  .bigstar{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end}

  /* footer */
  footer{margin-top:120px;border-top:1px solid var(--hair)}
  .fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:40px;padding:60px 0 40px}
  .fcol h4{font:600 11px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--mut);margin-bottom:16px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .fcol a{display:block;font:400 13.5px var(--sans);color:var(--ink);padding:5px 0;opacity:.78;transition:.2s}
  .fcol a:hover{opacity:1;color:var(--acc)}
  .fabout{font:400 13px/1.7 var(--sans);color:var(--mut);max-width:34ch}
  .fword{font:900 clamp(3.4rem,13.5vw,11rem)/1 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.02em;text-align:center;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px rgba(24,20,16,.28);user-select:none;transition:.5s;cursor:default;padding:10px 0 0}
  .fword:hover{color:var(--ink);-webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--ink)}
  .fbottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;font:400 11.5px var(--mono);color:var(--mut);padding:22px 0 30px;border-top:1px solid var(--hair);margin-top:26px}

  /* toast */
  #toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:26px;transform:translate(-50%,140%);background:var(--acc);color:var(--paper);font:600 13px var(--mono);padding:13px 22px;border-radius:8px;z-index:99;transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1);box-shadow:0 16px 40px -12px rgba(178,58,20,.6)}
  #toast.show{transform:translate(-50%,0)}

  /* reveal */
  .rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
  .rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}

  @media (max-width:900px){
    .navlinks{display:none}
    .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .stat:nth-child(odd){border-left:0}
    .stat:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid var(--hair)}
    .wrow{grid-template-columns:52px 1fr;gap:16px}
    .wrow svg{display:none}
    .bench-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px}
    .comm{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}
    .bigstar{justify-content:flex-start}
    .fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .brow{grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 96px;gap:10px}
    .chips .hint{display:none}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    *,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
    .rv{opacity:1;transform:none}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body id="top">

<!-- ============ header ============ -->
<header>
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Strata home">
      <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22"><rect x="1" y="1" width="20" height="5.2" fill="#D9481C"/><rect x="1" y="8.4" width="20" height="5.2" fill="#181410"/><rect x="1" y="15.8" width="20" height="5.2" fill="#181410"/></svg>
      STRATA
    </a>
    <nav class="navlinks">
      <a href="#why">Why</a>
      <a href="#pipeline">Pipeline</a>
      <a href="#bench">Benchmarks</a>
      <a href="#install">Install</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="starbtn" data-star>
      <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#181410" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 6 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.5L12 17.5l-5.9 3.1 1.2-6.5L2.5 9.5l6.6-.9z"/></svg>
      <span class="starcount">4,218</span>
    </button>
    <a class="btn-dl" href="#install">DOWNLOAD</a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ hero ============ -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">OPEN SOURCE · COLUMNAR · STREAMING · APACHE-2.0</p>
    <h1>
      <span class="h-sql">SELECT&nbsp;*&nbsp;FROM<span class="blink"></span></span>
      <span class="h-big">faster<i>.</i></span>
    </h1>
    <p class="sub">Strata is an open-source columnar database built <b>for data engineers</b> — streaming ingest, incremental materialized views, and Postgres wire compatibility in a single <b>42&nbsp;MB binary</b>. Clone it, fork it, ship it. The shell below is live: it runs in your tab, not on our servers.</p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="btn primary" href="#install">Get started
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="square"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#why">Why Strata</a>
    </div>

    <!-- live terminal -->
    <div class="term" id="term">
      <div class="term-bar">
        <span>strata — psql-compatible shell</span>
        <span>:5432 · in-browser engine</span>
      </div>
      <div class="term-out" id="tout"></div>
      <div class="term-line" id="tline">
        <span class="tp">strata&gt;&nbsp;</span>
        <span class="tinput"><span id="mpre"></span><span id="mcur">&nbsp;</span><span id="mpost"></span><span id="mph" class="ph">type `help` and hit enter</span></span>
        <input id="tinput" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" aria-label="SQL shell input">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chips">
      <button class="chip" data-q="help">help</button>
      <button class="chip" data-q="SELECT * FROM events LIMIT 4">SELECT * FROM events LIMIT 4</button>
      <button class="chip" data-q="SELECT region, mau FROM users WHERE mau > 80 ORDER BY mau DESC">region, mau WHERE mau &gt; 80</button>
      <button class="chip" data-q="DESCRIBE pipeline_runs">DESCRIBE pipeline_runs</button>
      <span class="hint">press <kbd>/</kbd> to focus · <kbd>↑</kbd> history</span>
    </div>

    <!-- stats -->
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="v"><span class="num" data-to="1.9" data-dec="1">0.0</span><em>GB/s</em></div><div class="l">SCAN THROUGHPUT · SINGLE NODE</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="v"><span class="num" data-to="42">0</span><em>MB</em></div><div class="l">ONE STATIC BINARY · ZERO DEPS</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="v">p99 <span class="num" data-to="6">0</span><em>ms</em></div><div class="l">POINT LOOKUP AT 10K QPS</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="v"><span class="num" data-to="214">0</span><em>+</em></div><div class="l">CONTRIBUTORS AND COUNTING</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ why ============ -->
<section id="why">
  <div class="wrap rv">
    <div class="shead"><span class="n">( 01 )</span><span class="t">WHY STRATA</span></div>
    <h2>Built for the people who move the data.</h2>
    <div class="why">
      <div class="wrow">
        <span class="idx">/ 01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Columnar, down to the metal</h3>
          <p>Native Parquet-backed storage with zone maps, dictionary encoding, and a vectorized execution engine. Scans run at memory bandwidth, not disk latency — and the query plan tells you exactly why.</p>
        </div>
        <svg width="88" height="80" viewBox="0 0 88 80" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6">
          <rect x="8" y="8" width="72" height="64" rx="4"/>
          <path d="M32 8v64M56 8v64M8 29h72M8 51h72"/>
          <rect x="36" y="14" width="16" height="10" fill="#D9481C" stroke="none"/>
          <rect x="36" y="34" width="16" height="12" fill="#D9481C" stroke="none"/>
          <rect x="36" y="56" width="16" height="9" fill="#D9481C" stroke="none"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="wrow">
        <span class="idx">/ 02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Streaming is the default</h3>
          <p>Attach a Kafka topic or a Postgres replica and tables stay continuously fresh. Incremental materialized views recompute only what changed — no orchestrator, no nightly <code class="k">FULL REFRESH</code> at 3&nbsp;a.m.</p>
        </div>
        <svg width="88" height="80" viewBox="0 0 88 80" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6">
          <path id="wstream" d="M8 40h60" stroke-dasharray="3 6"/>
          <path d="M60 32l10 8-10 8" stroke="#D9481C"/>
          <circle r="4" fill="#D9481C" stroke="none"><animateMotion dur="2.6s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M8 40h60"/></circle>
          <circle r="4" fill="#D9481C" stroke="none"><animateMotion dur="2.6s" begin="0.9s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M8 40h60"/></circle>
          <circle r="4" fill="#D9481C" stroke="none"><animateMotion dur="2.6s" begin="1.8s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M8 40h60"/></circle>
          <rect x="8" y="14" width="14" height="52" rx="2"/>
          <rect x="70" y="14" width="10" height="52" rx="2"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="wrow">
        <span class="idx">/ 03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Speaks Postgres fluently</h3>
          <p>The wire protocol, the catalog, the flags you already know. Point Metabase, Airbyte or dbt at it and they just work — <code class="k">psql</code> included. Your muscle memory is the migration plan.</p>
        </div>
        <svg width="88" height="80" viewBox="0 0 88 80" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6">
          <path d="M6 30h26M6 50h26"/>
